# 🏛️ ALEXANDRIA — CURSOR RULES
# Governing architecture, quality gates, and 225 master capsules.

- Operating under Alexandria Deterministic Kernel v1.2.0.
- Mandatory: Zero blind edits. Inspect or read target file before modifying (Fact-Forcing GateGuard E_FACT_FORCING).
- Strict TDD: Write failing assertion test in tests/ (RED), write minimal code in src/ (GREEN), refactor with nominal types (REFACTOR).
- Zero explicit any (TSAnyKeyword), zero double cast (as unknown as T).
- 225 Master Capsules in .alexandria/capsules/ covering 69+ technologies.
